#!/bin/sh
echo AURORA_STAGE20_DIAGNOSTICS
uname -a
cat /proc/uptime
cat /proc/mounts
for d in /sys/class/udc/*; do
    [ -d "$d" ] || continue
    echo "UDC $d"
    cat "$d/state" 2>/dev/null
done
for d in /sys/class/thermal/thermal_zone*; do
    [ -d "$d" ] || continue
    echo "THERMAL $d"
    cat "$d/type" "$d/temp" 2>/dev/null
done
echo 'Values are unvalidated; a thermal value alone does not prove battery protection.'
